---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Our Story" description="Olive Branch Coffee Co. is a mobile coffee startup serving Moreno Valley, CA.">
  <section class="section max-w-3xl">
    <p class="eyebrow">Our Story</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold">Coffee that comes to you</h1>

    <div class="mt-8 aspect-[16/9] w-full rounded-2xl bg-olive-200"></div>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-olive-700">
      <p>
        Olive Branch Coffee Co. is a startup with one idea driving it: good coffee shouldn't
        be tied to a single address. Instead of opening a storefront, we're building a mobile
        coffee service — carts, pop-ups, and event setups — so we can show up where our
        community already is, whether that's a farmers market, an office park, or someone's
        backyard.
      </p>
      <p>
        We source from small roasters we trust and keep things simple, because when you're
        mobile, every detail has to earn its place on the cart.
      </p>
      <p>
        Right now, that means you'll find us at seasonal pop-ups and private events rather
        than behind a counter. If you'd like us to bring the cart to your gathering, visit
        our <a href="/events" class="font-medium text-clay-500 hover:text-clay-600">events page</a> to start a request.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
